<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ethan Allen raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ethan Allen raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Wheat First Butcher Singer raised its recommendation on Ethan Allen Interiors Inc to buy from outperform, according to the analyst's office.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-5/8 to 43-1/4 in mornings trade, easing off an earlier, new year-high of 43-1/2. The old year-high was 41-3/4.</p>
</text>
